    "body": "Looks good, good tests, docs updated, almost all good to go. I did spend about 30 minutes trying to figure out why you modified all these tests to (what appears on the surface) break them by discarding the version numbers.\r\n\r\nI think I see now why that needs to be done. If possible, I'd love to modify the `expect_output` function so that it can match a version number regex at the end, just to verify that we're reading version numbers and not arbitrary garbage off of the `dotnet` program. \r\n\r\nHowever, if that's not possible, I'll take a comment describing why this is the correct test to run (either at module-level or at first-use).",
